    <div id="root"><div class="app-container"><header class="navbar-header"><nav class="navbar-container"><a class="brand-logo" href="https://www.noteshub.store/" data-discover="true"><div class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></div><div class="logo-text"><span class="logo-accent">Notes</span><span class="logo-main">Hub</span></div></a><ul class="desktop-nav-links"><li><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.noteshub.store/" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Home</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.noteshub.store/btech" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark"></i> B.Tech Notes</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.noteshub.store/about-us" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> About Us</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.noteshub.store/contact-us" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Contact Us</a></li></ul><div class="desktop-action"><a class="login-btn" href="https://www.noteshub.store/btech" data-discover="true"><span>Explore Notes</span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div><button class="mobile-toggle-btn" aria-label="Toggle navigation"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars-staggered"></i></button></nav></header><main class="main-content"><div class="year-page-container"><div class="year-header"><span class="year-tag">First Year B.Tech</span><h1 class="year-title">1st Year Syllabus &amp; Subjects</h1><p class="year-desc">Select your engineering branch to view subjects and download unit-wise PDF notes.</p></div><div class="btech-top-intro-card" style="padding: 24px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 20px 0px 30px; color: rgb(51, 65, 85); line-height: 1.75; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02) 0px 2px 4px;"><h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(15, 23, 42); margin: 0px 0px 10px;">AKTU B.Tech First Year (Semesters 1 &amp; 2) Complete Academic Guide</h3><p style="margin: 0px 0px 12px; font-size: 0.98rem;">Stepping into the first year of B.Tech under Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU) is a crucial milestone for every engineering aspirant. The 1st year curriculum is designed to establish a common scientific and technological foundation across all core disciplines—including Computer Science, Information Technology, Electronics, Mechanical, and Civil Engineering.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 0.98rem;">To ensure a smooth transition from school to university-level engineering academics, our portal provides systematically arranged branch-wise subjects, verified course codes (such as BAS103, BCS101, BAS101), and direct unit-wise PDF study resources. Select your engineering branch below to explore available subjects and start preparing with topper-recommended materials.</p></div><div class="branch-section"><h2 class="section-title">Select Your Branch</h2><div class="branch-chips-wrapper"><button class="branch-chip active"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i><span>CSE</span></button><button class="branch-chip "><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i><span>IT</span></button><button class="branch-chip "><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i><span>ECE</span></button><button class="branch-chip "><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i><span>ME</span></button><button class="branch-chip "><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i><span>CE</span></button></div></div><div class="subjects-section"><div class="subjects-header"><h3>Subjects for <span class="highlight-text">CSE</span></h3><span class="count-badge">4 Available</span></div><div class="subjects-list-grid"><div class="subject-row-card"><div class="subject-info"><span class="sub-code">BAS103</span><h4 class="sub-title">Engineering Mathematics-I</h4><span class="sub-units">5 Units Available</span></div><button class="btn-open-subject"><span>View Notes</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></button></div><div class="subject-row-card"><div class="subject-info"><span class="sub-code">BCS101</span><h4 class="sub-title">Programming for Problem Solving (C)</h4><span class="sub-units">5 Units Available</span></div><button class="btn-open-subject"><span>View Notes</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></button></div><div class="subject-row-card"><div class="subject-info"><span class="sub-code">BAS101</span><h4 class="sub-title">Engineering Physics</h4><span class="sub-units">5 Units Available</span></div><button class="btn-open-subject"><span>View Notes</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></button></div><div class="subject-row-card"><div class="subject-info"><span class="sub-code">BEE101</span><h4 class="sub-title">Basic Electrical Engineering</h4><span class="sub-units">5 Units Available</span></div><button class="btn-open-subject"><span>View Notes</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></button></div></div></div><div class="btech-seo-section"><div class="btech-seo-main-card"><h2>Build a Strong Engineering Foundation in 1st Year</h2><p>The first year of B.Tech under Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU) sets the foundational base for all engineering streams. Whether you belong to Computer Science, Information Technology, Electronics, Mechanical, or Civil Engineering, students study core fundamental sciences and basic engineering concepts designed to enhance analytical thinking. Our platform provides structured branch-wise segregation, precise subject codes, and accessible unit-wise materials to help you excel in semester examinations effortlessly.</p></div><div class="btech-seo-grid"><div class="btech-seo-feature-card"><div class="feature-icon" style="color: rgb(37, 99, 235); background: rgb(239, 246, 255);"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark"></i></div><h4>Unit-Wise Organization</h4><p>Study systematically unit by unit to cover the complete university syllabus efficiently.</p></div><div class="btech-seo-feature-card"><div class="feature-icon" style="color: rgb(22, 163, 74); background: rgb(240, 253, 244);"><i class="fa-solid fa-hashtag"></i></div><h4>Accurate Subject Codes</h4><p>Cross-check official curriculum codes like BAS103, BCS101 before your semester examinations.</p></div><div class="btech-seo-feature-card"><div class="feature-icon" style="color: rgb(147, 51, 234); background: rgb(250, 245, 255);"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i></div><h4>Targeted Prep</h4><p>Focus directly on core concepts and high-weightage topics to maximize your GPA.</p></div></div><div class="btech-deep-article-card" style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 30px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); color: rgb(51, 65, 85); line-height: 1.8;"><h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(15, 23, 42); margin-bottom: 14px;">Comprehensive Syllabus Roadmap &amp; Preparation Strategy for AKTU 1st Year Students</h3><p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">A high Grade Point Average (SGPA/CGPA) achieved in the first year provides a strong buffer for upcoming advanced semesters. Since first-year subjects carry uniform credit distribution across physics, chemistry, mathematics, and basic programming, scoring well requires balanced focus across both semesters. Below is an in-depth breakdown of core modules and preparation strategies:</p><h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Fundamental Applied Mathematics (Engineering Mathematics-I &amp; II)</h4><p style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Mathematics (BAS103/BAS203) serves as the analytical core for all engineering branches. Topics such as Differential Calculus, Matrices, Vector Calculus, Multiple Integrals, and Differential Equations demand rigorous step-by-step practice. Evaluators at AKTU look for clear steps, correct formula application, and neat final solutions. Solving textbook derivations along with 5-year past papers ensures maximum accuracy in Section B and Section C numericals.</p><h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Programming for Problem Solving (C Language - BCS101/BCS201)</h4><p style="margin-bottom: 14px;">For CSE, IT, and non-computer branches alike, C Programming builds algorithmic logic. First-year students must master fundamental concepts including control flow structures (if-else, switch case), loops, arrays, pointers, functions, structures, and dynamic memory allocation. In university exams, writing clean, syntax-accurate code snippets along with flowcharts and step-by-step variable dry runs guarantees high marks.</p><h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Engineering Physics &amp; Engineering Chemistry (BAS101 / BAS102)</h4><p style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Applied sciences bridge school-level physics and chemistry with real-world engineering applications. Physics topics include Quantum Mechanics, Wave Optics, Fiber Optics, and Electromagnetism, while Chemistry covers Water Technology, Polymers, Nanomaterials, and Spectroscopic Techniques. Memorizing standard derivations, ray diagrams, and molecular orbital diagrams is essential for theoretical questions.</p><h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Basic Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering (BEE101 / BEC101)</h4><p style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Electrical and electronics modules introduce circuit analysis techniques such as Kirchhoff’s Laws (KCL/KVL), Mesh Analysis, Thevenin’s Theorem, Norton’s Theorem, AC Fundamentals, Transformers, and Semiconductor Diodes. Practicing circuit diagrams with labeled polarities and solving standard numerical problems is the key to scoring 90%+ in these core evaluation papers.</p><h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pro Tips for Securing 9+ SGPA in AKTU 1st Year Exams:</h4><ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Strict 5-Unit Coverage:</strong> AKTU sets questions evenly across all 5 units. Avoid skipping any unit completely.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Neat Diagrammatic Representation:</strong> Use a pencil and ruler to draw clear circuit schematics, block diagrams, and flowcharts.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Section A Mastery:</strong> Section A consists of short 2-mark conceptual questions. Reviewing unit definitions and basic formulas ensures a quick 20/20 score in this section.</li><li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Time Management:</strong> Practice solving 10-mark long answer questions within 20–25 minutes during exam simulations to avoid leaving questions unanswered.</li></ul><p style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 0.95rem;">Use the branch tabs above to navigate directly to your required subject and access unit-wise handwritten notes curated specifically for AKTU university examinations.</p></div></div></div></main><footer class="footer-section"><div class="footer-container"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-col brand-col"><a class="footer-logo" href="https://www.noteshub.store/" data-discover="true"><div class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></div><div class="logo-text"><span class="logo-accent">Notes</span><span class="logo-main">Hub</span></div></a><p class="brand-desc">Your one-stop destination for quality B.Tech notes, previous year question papers (PYQs), placement roadmaps, and study guides.</p></div><div class="footer-col"><h4 class="footer-title">Quick Links</h4><ul class="footer-links"><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> Home</a></li><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/btech" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> B.Tech Notes</a></li><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/about-us" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> About Us</a></li><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/contact-us" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> Contact Us</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-col"><h4 class="footer-title">Legal &amp; Policies</h4><ul class="footer-links"><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/privacy-policy" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/terms-conditions" data-discover="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i> Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-col"><h4 class="footer-title">Get in Touch</h4><div class="contact-info"><div class="contact-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i><span>support@noteshub.com</span></div><div class="contact-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i><span>India</span></div></div></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><p>© 2026 Notes Hub. All rights reserved.</p><div class="bottom-links"><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/privacy-policy" data-discover="true">Privacy Policy</a><span class="dot">•</span><a href="https://www.noteshub.store/terms-conditions" data-discover="true">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></div></div></div></footer></div></div>
  

